From 27f98bba97f6590251920cecd14fd5331d10cd0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Synthetic Benchmark Review <review@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:53:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] Add strict planner-scoped cardinality replay

Read precomputed subset cardinalities under the caller's permissions
and keep the validated cache within one planner invocation. Reject
missing, malformed, duplicate, or non-finite inputs and unsupported
query scopes instead of mixing replay with native estimates.

Invalidate cached plans when the replay key changes and record the
cache relation dependency. Preserve native join-pair costing and
cover fresh planning, key changes, aliases, errors, and role changes.

Handle a rollout completion that already consists of a single clump,
as exercised by the two-table replay integration case.
